# The Warrior's Path (CoP 7-5): Al'Taieu's zone-in finish for races 2 to 7, each at Status 3 with the drained
# amulet and the light of its race (GMs). Each: zone-in 1; finished: AMULET_SHATTERED (7522), LIGHT_STOLEN (7523) for
# the race's light (race 2: Light of Vahzl, 3 and 4: Mea, 5 and 6: Holla, 7: Dem), the light and the amulet removed,
# Light of Al'Taieu given (6398), the title, and the mission completes.
lists Altaieu/onZoneIn/1 Altaieu/onEventFinish/1
char zone=Altaieu pos=-422,0,-532 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=2
char bob zone=Altaieu pos=-422,0,-532 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=3
char cat zone=Altaieu pos=-422,0,-532 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=4
char dan zone=Altaieu pos=-422,0,-532 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=5
char eve zone=Altaieu pos=-422,0,-532 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=6
char fay zone=Altaieu pos=-422,0,-532 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=7
mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
keyitem MysteriousAmuletDrained
keyitem LightOfVahzl
bob: mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
bob: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
bob: keyitem MysteriousAmuletDrained
bob: keyitem LightOfMea
cat: mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
cat: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
cat: keyitem MysteriousAmuletDrained
cat: keyitem LightOfMea
dan: mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
dan: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
dan: keyitem MysteriousAmuletDrained
dan: keyitem LightOfHolla
eve: mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
eve: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
eve: keyitem MysteriousAmuletDrained
eve: keyitem LightOfHolla
fay: mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
fay: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
fay: keyitem MysteriousAmuletDrained
fay: keyitem LightOfDem
login open                              # race 2: 1
finish                                  # Light of Vahzl stolen
bob: login open
bob: finish                             # race 3: Mea
cat: login open
cat: finish                             # race 4: Mea
dan: login open
dan: finish                             # race 5: Holla
eve: login open
eve: finish                             # race 6: Holla
fay: login open
fay: finish                             # race 7: Dem
